    <string name="arena_how_to_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="arena_how_to_body">• Drag tiles from your rack onto empty cells, or tap a tile and then a cell.\n• All tiles of a turn must sit in one word, and every one must be right, or the turn is lost.\n• Each letter scores 1 point; bonus cells marked +2 or +3 score that much instead. Finishing a word adds its length.\n• Submit to score and refill your rack, or Pass. The match ends when the grid is full or nobody scores for two rounds.</string>
